==== Hardware info ====
^ Architecture     | MIPS                                    |
^ Vendor           | Broadcom                                |
^ Bootloader       | CFE                                     |
^ System-On-Chip   | Broadcom BCM4716B0KFBG                  |
^ CPU Speed        | 300MHz                                  |
^ Flash-Chip       | Winbond 25X32VF1G                       |
^ Flash size       | 4MB                                     |
^ RAM              | Winbond W9425G6EH 32MB SDRAM            |
^ Wireless         | Broadcom BCM4329 ? (integrated)         |
^ Ethernet         | Broadcom BCM5325EKQMG (4 port switch)   |
^ USB              | No                                      |
^ Serial           | [[#Serial|Yes]]                         |
^ JTAG             | Yes (no header)                         |
